sting the &quot;Sight&quot; of your crawler against CSS cloaking techniques</p></div><a class=\"p-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700 transition-all\" href=\"/test/dynamic\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-12 rounded-3xl bg-[#0f0f12] border border-slate-800 min-h-[400px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center space-y-8 relative\"><div class=\"space-y-6 max-w-md\"><div class=\"w-20 h-20 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-blue-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye-off w-10 h-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.733 5.076a10.744 10.744 0 0 1 11.205 6.575 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.747 10.747 0 0 1-1.444 2.49\"></path><path d=\"M14.084 14.158a3 3 0 0 1-4.242-4.242\"></path><path d=\"M17.479 17.499a10.75 10.75 0 0 1-15.417-5.151 1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 4.446-5.143\"></path><path d=\"m2 2 20 20\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">Content Cloaked</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400\">Target assets are present in the DOM but visually hidden using various CSS techniques.</p><button class=\"px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold transition-all shadow-lg bg-blue-600 text-white hover:bg-blue-500 shadow-blue-500/20\">Reveal All</button></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-12 w-full max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 text-left flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 block mb-1\">display-none</span><div style=\"display:none\" class=\"text-white font-medium\">Display None<!-- -->: SECRET_DATA_<!-- -->DISPLAY-NONE</div></div><div class=\"text-right\"><p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 max-w-[150px] leading-tight\">Element is removed from the layout entirely.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 text-left flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 block mb-1\">visibility-hidden</span><div style=\"visibility:hidden\" class=\"text-white font-medium\">Visibility Hidden<!-- -->: SECRET_DATA_<!-- -->VISIBILITY-HIDDEN</div></div><div class=\"text-right\"><p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 max-w-[150px] leading-tight\">Element is invisible but still takes up space.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 text-left flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 block mb-1\">opacity-zero</span><div style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"text-white font-medium\">Opacity Zero<!-- -->: SECRET_DATA_<!-- -->OPACITY-ZERO</div></div><div class=\"text-right\"><p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 max-w-[150px] leading-tight\">Element is fully transparent.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 text-left flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 block mb-1\">off-screen</span><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\" class=\"text-white font-medium\">Off-screen<!-- -->: SECRET_DATA_<!-- -->OFF-SCREEN</div></div><div class=\"text-right\"><p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 max-w-[150px] leading-tight\">Element is positioned far outside the viewport.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 text-left flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 block mb-1\">z-index-minus</span><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:-1\" class=\"text-white font-medium\">Z-Index Minus<!-- -->: SECRET_DATA_<!-- -->Z-INDEX-MINUS</div></div><div class=\"text-right\"><p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 max-w-[150px] leading-tight\">Element is layered behind the background.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 text-left flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 block mb-1\">clip-path</span><div style=\"clip-path:inset(50% 50% 50% 50%)\" class=\"text-white font-medium\">Clip Path<!-- -->: SECRET_DATA_<!-- -->CLIP-PATH</div></div><div class=\"text-right\"><p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-600 max-w-[150px] leading-tight\">Element is clipped to 0% size.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white mb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-alert lucide-alert-circle w-6 h-6 text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Crawler Challenge</h3></div><p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">This page tests if a bot can identify &quot;invisible&quot; content. Many cloaking techniques rely on the fact that simple scrapers only look at the raw HTML or don&#x27;t calculate computed styles.<br/><br/>A high-quality crawler should check for <code class=\"text-blue-400\">computedStyles</code>to detect if an element is actually visible to the user.</p></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0jvhpaew_uadu.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><sc